messages.plain:
Al-imaam Ibn ‘Uthaymeen رحمه الله said:
O Muslims, the gap between us and victory is wide if we follow this path, because victory has conditions without which it will never be realized. Listen to them from the words of the One in Whose hand is the dominion of the heavens and the earth, and by Whose command come victory and defeat. Allaah, Exalted is He, says: { And Allaah will surely support those who support Him. Indeed, Allaah is Powerful, Mighty }

O Muslims, who is it that supports Allaah?

Listen, listen to the answer from the words of Allaah: { Those who, if We give them authority in the land, establish the prayer, give the zakaat, enjoin what is right, and forbid what is wrong. And to Allaah belongs the outcome of all matters }

Yes, those deserving of victory are the ones who, if Allaah grants them authority in the land, establish the prayer, give the zakaat, enjoin what is right, and forbid what is wrong.

I said: Do not place the blame on others. We all deserve it.

{ وَمَن یَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ یَجۡعَل لَّهُۥ مَخۡرَجࣰا }
[سُورَةُ الطَّلَاقِ: ٢]

And whosoever fears Allâh and keeps his duty to Him, He will make a way for him to get out (from every difficulty).

{ وَیَرۡزُقۡهُ مِنۡ حَیۡثُ لَا یَحۡتَسِبُۚ وَمَن یَتَوَكَّلۡ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَهُوَ حَسۡبُهُۥۤۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بَـٰلِغُ أَمۡرِهِۦۚ قَدۡ جَعَلَ ٱللَّهُ لِكُلِّ شَیۡءࣲ قَدۡرࣰا }
[سُورَةُ الطَّلَاقِ: ٣]

And He will provide him from (sources) he never could imagine. And whosoever puts his trust in Allâh, then He will suffice him. Verily, Allâh will accomplish his purpose. Indeed Allâh has set a measure for all things.


{ وَمَن یَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ یَجۡعَل لَّهُۥ مِنۡ أَمۡرِهِۦ یُسۡرࣰا }
[سُورَةُ الطَّلَاقِ: ٤]

and whosoever fears Allâh and keeps his duty to Him, He will make his matter easy for him.


{ وَمَن یَتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ یُكَفِّرۡ عَنۡهُ سَیِّـَٔاتِهِۦ وَیُعۡظِمۡ لَهُۥۤ أَجۡرًا }
[سُورَةُ الطَّلَاقِ: ٥]

and whosoever fears Allâh and keeps his duty to Him, He will expiate from him his sins, and will enlarge his reward.

Hilāli & Khān
